    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Courier Services theme is a professionally structured solution tailored for logistics companies, delivery startups, parcel tracking platforms, and transportation businesses that require a clean and organized website layout. Supporting essential features like shipment information sections, service listings, courier booking forms, and delivery status pages, it helps corporations present their logistics operations clearly. Its lightweight design ensures smooth functionality with modern tools and allows for easy customization without the need for complex setup. This theme is ideal for courier companies, logistics service providers, freight businesses, package delivery services, and supply chain websites seeking a functional online presence. It offers layouts specifically for courier tracking, shipment management, transportation services, and delivery booking pages. With compatibility for common plugins and a flexible design structure, the Online Courier Services theme enables logistics businesses to efficiently create an informative courier website, parcel service portal, or delivery management site."
    },
